<title>JAPAN: Kokusan Denki -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kokusan Denki -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.83		vs	    8.58</p>
<p> Operating	  226    million	  vs	  182    million</p>
<p> Current	    248    million	  vs	  199    million</p>
<p> Net		   90    million	  vs	   96    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.05 yen	  vs	    6.46 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     15 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kokusan Denki Co Ltd is a member of Hitachi Ltd&quot;s rollingstock parts manufacturing group.</p>
</text>
